msgstr "标记标识。"

msgid "Entity Type"
msgstr "实体类型"

msgid "The Entity Type."
msgstr "实体类型。"

msgid "Entity ID"
msgstr "实体标识"

msgid "The Entity ID."
msgstr "实体标识。"

msgid "Entity"
msgstr "实体"

msgid "The flagged entity."
msgstr "已添加标记的实体。"

msgid "A boolean indicating whether the flagging is global."
msgstr "布尔值，指示标记是否为全局标记。"

msgid "User ID"
msgstr "用户标识"

msgid "The user ID of the flagging user. This is recorded for both global and personal flags."
msgstr "标记用户的用户标识。 对于全局标记和个人标记都会记录此标识。"

msgid "Session ID"
msgstr "会话标识"

msgid "The session ID associated with an anonymous user."
msgstr "与匿名用户关联的会话标识。"

msgid "Created"
msgstr "已创建"

msgid "The time that the flagging was created."
msgstr "创建标记的时间。"

msgid "flagging"
msgstr "标记操作"

msgid "flaggings"
msgstr "标记操作"

msgid "Flag %flag_title"
msgstr "对 %flag_title 添加标志"

msgid "Unflag %flag_title"
msgstr "对 %flag_title 取消标志"

msgid "The scope cannot be changed once a flag has been saved."
msgstr "保存标记后无法再更改范围。"

msgid "Create Flag"
msgstr "创建标志"

msgid "Type of item to reference. This cannot be changed once the flag is created."
msgstr "要参考的项的类型。 创建标记后将不能更改。"

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "继续"

msgid "Flag this content"
msgstr "标记此内容"

msgid "Create flagging"
msgstr "创建标志操作"

msgid "Disable flag @name?"
msgstr "禁用标记 @name？"

msgid "Enable flag @name?"
msgstr "启用标记 @name？"

msgid "Users will no longer be able to use the flag, but no data will be lost."
msgstr "用户将无法使用标记，但不会丢失任何数据。"

msgid "The flag will appear once more on configured nodes."
msgstr "标记将在配置的节点上再次出现。"

msgid "The scope cannot be changed on existing flags."
msgstr "针对现有标记的范围无法更改。"

msgid "Save Flag"
msgstr "保存标志"

msgid "Label"
msgstr "标签"

msgid "A short, descriptive title for this flag. It will be used in administrative interfaces to refer to this flag, and in page titles and menu items of some views this module provides (these are customizable, though). Some examples could be <em>Bookmarks</em>, <em>Favorites</em>, or <em>Offensive</em>."
msgstr "此标记的描述性短标题。 它将用于管理界面以指代此标记，并将用于此模块提供的某些视图的页面标题和菜单项中（尽管可对这些项进行定制）。 比如 <em>Bookmarks</em>、<em>Favorites</em> 或 <em>Offensive</em>。"

msgid "Machine name"
msgstr "机器名"

msgid "The machine-name for this flag. It may be up to 32 characters long and may only contain lowercase letters, underscores, and numbers. It will be used in URLs and in all API calls."
msgstr "此标志的机器名。 它最多可包含 32 个字符，并且只能包含小写字母、下划线和数字。 它将在 URL 和所有 API 调用中使用。"

msgid "Each user has individual flags on entities."
msgstr "每个用户都具有有关实体的个别标记。"

msgid "The entity is either flagged or not for all users."
msgstr "对于所有用户，实体均为已标记或未标记。"

msgid "Messages"
msgstr "消息"

msgid "Flag this item"
msgstr "标记此项"

msgid "The text for the \"flag this\" link for this flag."
msgstr "此标志的“对此项添加标志”链接的文本。"

msgid "Flag link description"
msgstr "添加标志操作的链接描述"

msgid "The description of the \"flag this\" link. Usually displayed on mouseover."
msgstr "“对此项添加标志”链接的描述。 通常在鼠标悬停时显示。"

msgid "Flagged message"
msgstr "添加标志的消息"

msgid "Message displayed after flagging content. If JavaScript is enabled, it will be displayed below the link. If not, it will be displayed in the message area."
msgstr "对内容添加标志后显示的消息。 如果已启用 JavaScript，那么它将显示在链接下方。 如果未启用 JavaScript，它将显示在消息区域中。"

msgid "Unflag this item"
msgstr "取消标记此项"

msgid "The text for the \"unflag this\" link for this flag."
msgstr "此标志的“对此项取消标志”链接的文本。"

msgid "Unflag link description"
msgstr "取消标志操作的链接描述"

msgid "The description of the \"unflag this\" link. Usually displayed on mouseover."
msgstr "\"对此项取消标志\"链接的描述。 通常在鼠标悬停时显示。"

msgid "Unflagged message"
msgstr "取消标志的消息"

msgid "Message displayed after content has been unflagged. If JavaScript is enabled, it will be displayed below the link. If not, it will be displayed in the message area."
msgstr "对内容取消标志后显示的消息。 如果已启用 JavaScript，那么它将显示在链接下方。 如果未启用 JavaScript，它将显示在消息区域中。"

msgid "Flag access"
msgstr "标志访问权"

msgid "Flaggable types"
msgstr "可执行标志操作的类型"

msgid "Check any bundles that this flag may be used on. Leave empty to apply to all bundles."
msgstr "选中此标记可能用于的任何捆绑软件。 留空以应用于所有捆绑软件。"

msgid "Unflag not allowed text"
msgstr "“不允许取消标志”文本"

msgid "If a user is allowed to flag but not unflag, this text will be displayed after flagging. Often this is the past-tense of the link text, such as \"flagged\"."
msgstr "如果允许用户添加标志但不允许取消标志，那么此文本将在标志操作后显示。 通常这是链接文本的过去式，例如“已添加标志”。"

msgid "Display options"
msgstr "显示选项"

msgid "Flags are usually controlled through links that allow users to toggle their behavior. You can choose how users interact with flags by changing options here. It is legitimate to have none of the following checkboxes ticked, if, for some reason, you wish <a href=\"@placement-url\">to place the links on the page yourself</a>."
msgstr "通常通过允许用户切换其行为的链接来控制标志。 您可以通过在此处更改选项，选择用户与标志的互动方式。 如果出于某种原因，您希望<a href=\"@placement-url\">自己在页面上放置链接</a>，那么不选中以下所有复选框是合法的。"

msgid "Link type"
msgstr "链接类型"

msgid "Update"
msgstr "更新"

msgid "Flag %label has been updated."
msgstr "已更新标志 %label。"

msgid "Flag %label has been added."
msgstr "已添加标志 %label。"

msgid "Are you sure you want to reset the Flag %label?"
msgstr "确定要重置标志 %label 吗？"

msgid "All flaggings created with Flag %label will be deleted."
msgstr "将删除使用标志 %label 创建的所有标志操作。"

msgid "Flag %label was reset."
msgstr "标志 %label 已重置。"

msgid "Create Flagging"
msgstr "创建标记操作"

msgid "Update Flagging"
msgstr "更新标记操作"

msgid "Delete Flagging"
msgstr "删除标记操作"

msgid "Delete flagging"
msgstr "删除标记操作"

msgid "Unflag this content"
msgstr "取消标记此内容"

msgid "Unflag"
msgstr "取消标志"

msgid "Delete flagging (unflag)"
msgstr "删除标记（取消标记）"

msgid "Flag/unflag entities"
msgstr "对实体添加标记/取消标记"

msgid "AJAX link"
msgstr "AJAX 链接"

msgid "An AJAX JavaScript request will be made without reloading the page."
msgstr "无需重新加载页面即可发出 AJAX JavaScript 请求。"

msgid "Confirm Form"
msgstr "确认表单"

msgid "Redirects the user to a confirmation form."
msgstr "将用户重定向到确认表单。"

msgid "Enter flagging details"
msgstr "输入标记详细信息"

msgid "Edit flagging details"
msgstr "编辑标记详细信息"

msgid "Update flagging"
msgstr "更新标记操作"

msgid "Edit flagging details message"
msgstr "编辑标记详细信息消息"

msgid "Message displayed if the user has clicked the \"Edit flag\" link. Usually presented in the form such as, \"Please enter the flagging details.\""
msgstr "如果用户单击“编辑标志”链接，那么会显示消息。 通常以“请输入标志操作详细信息”等形式显示。"

msgid "The text for the submit button when updating a flagging."
msgstr "更新标记时该提交按钮的文本。"

msgid "An edit flagging details message is required when using the field entry link type."
msgstr "使用字段输入链接类型时需要一条编辑标记详细信息消息。"

msgid "Field Entry Form"
msgstr "字段输入表单"

msgid "Redirects the user to a field entry form."
msgstr "将用户重定向到字段输入表单。"

msgid "Flag this content?"
msgstr "标记此内容？"

msgid "Unflag this content?"
msgstr "取消标记此内容？"

msgid "Options for the \"@label\" link type"
msgstr "“@label”链接类型的选项"

msgid "Flag confirmation message"
msgstr "标志确认消息"

msgid "Message displayed if the user has clicked the \"flag this\" link and confirmation is required. Usually presented in the form of a question such as, \"Are you sure you want to flag this content?\""
msgstr "如果用户单击了“对此项添加标志”链接并需要确认，那么会显示消息。 通常以“确定要对此内容添加标志吗？”这样的问题形式显示。"

msgid "Unflag confirmation message"
msgstr "取消标志确认消息"

msgid "Message displayed if the user has clicked the \"unflag this\" link and confirmation is required. Usually presented in the form of a question such as, \"Are you sure you want to unflag this content?\""
msgstr "如果用户单击了\"对此项取消标志\"链接并需要确认，那么会显示消息。 通常以\"确定要对此内容取消标志吗？\"这样的问题形式显示。"

msgid "The text for the submit button when creating a flagging."
msgstr "创建标记时该提交按钮的文本。"

msgid "The text for the submit button when deleting a flagging."
msgstr "删除标记时该提交按钮的文本。"

msgid "Form behavior"
msgstr "表单行为"

msgid "New page"
msgstr "新建页面"

msgid "Dialog"
msgstr "对话框"

msgid "Modal dialog"
msgstr "模态对话框"

msgid "If an option other than <em>new page</em> is selected, the form will open via AJAX on the same page."
msgstr "如果选择了<em>新建页面</em>以外的选项，将在相同页面上通过 AJAX 打开表单。"

msgid "A flag confirmation message is required when using the \"@label\" link type."
msgstr "使用“@label”链接类型时需要标志确认消息。"

msgid "An unflag confirmation message is required when using the \"@label\" link type."
msgstr "使用“@label”链接类型时需要取消标志确认消息。"

msgid "Normal link"
msgstr "正常链接"

msgid "A normal non-JavaScript request will be made and the current page will be reloaded."
msgstr "将发出正常的非 JavaScript 请求，并且将重新加载当前页面。"

msgid "Permissions based on ownership of a comment's parent entity."
msgstr "基于注释的父实体所有权的许可"

msgid "Flag %flag_title comments on own parent entities"
msgstr "对自身父实体上的 %flag_title 注释添加标志"

msgid "Unflag %flag_title on own parent entities"
msgstr "对自身父实体上的 %flag_title 取消标志"

msgid "Flag %flag_title on others' parent entities"
msgstr "对其他父实体上的 %flag_title 添加标志"

msgid "Unflag %flag_title on others' parent entities"
msgstr "对其他父实体上的 %flag_title 取消标志"

msgid "Comment"
msgstr "注释"

msgid "Display link as field"
msgstr "将链接显示为字段"

msgid "Show the flag link as a field, which can be ordered among other entity elements in the \"Manage display\" settings for the entity type."
msgstr "将标志链接显示为字段，该字段可在实体类型的“管理显示”设置中与其他实体元素一起进行排序。"

msgid "Display checkbox on entity edit form"
msgstr "在实体编辑表单上显示复选框"

msgid "Display in contextual links"
msgstr "在上下文链接中显示"

msgid ""
"Note that not all entity types support contextual links.\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <strong>Warning: </strong>Due to how contextual links are cached on frontend\n"
"        we have to set max-age as 0 for entity cache if\n"
"        user has access to contextual links and to this flag. This means that\n"
"        those users will get no cache hits for render elements rendering flaggable\n"
"        entities with contextual links."
msgstr ""
"请注意，并非所有实体类型都支持上下文链接。\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <strong>警告：</strong>由于在前端高速缓存上下文链接的方式，因此，\n"
"如果用户有权访问上下文链接和此标志，\n"
"那么对于实体高速缓存，我们必须将 max-age 设置为 0。 这意味着对于呈现具有上下文链接的可标志实体的呈现元素，\n"
"这些用户将不会在高速缓存中命中。\n"
""

msgid "Display on @name view mode"
msgstr "以 @name 视图方式显示"

msgid "Display in entity links"
msgstr "显示在实体链接中"

msgid "Show the flag link with the other links on the entity."
msgstr "显示有关实体的该标记链接和其他链接。"

msgid "Expose additional permissions"
msgstr "公开附加许可权"

msgid "Provides permissions with finer levels of access for this flag."
msgstr "提供对此标记具有更高级别访问权的许可。"

msgid "Permissions based on ownership of the flaggable item. For example, only allow users to flag items they own."
msgstr "基于可标记项的所有权的许可。 例如，仅允许用户标记其拥有的项。"

msgid "Flag %flag_title own items"
msgstr "对 %flag_title 自己的项添加标志"

msgid "Unflag %flag_title own items"
msgstr "对 %flag_title 自己的项取消标志"

msgid "Flag %flag_title others' items"
msgstr "对 %flag_title 其他人的项添加标志"

msgid "Unflag %flag_title others' items"
msgstr "对 %flag_title 其他人的项取消标志"

msgid "Flag Type Entity"
msgstr "标记类型实体"

msgid "Display link on user profile page"
msgstr "在用户个人档案页面上显示链接"

msgid "Show the link formatted as a user profile element."
msgstr "显示格式化为用户概要文件元素的链接。"

msgid "Permissions for users to flag themselves."
msgstr "用户对自身进行标记的许可权。"

msgid "Flag %flag_title own profile"
msgstr "对 %flag_title 自己的个人档案添加标志"

msgid "Unflag %flag_title own profile"
msgstr "对 %flag_title 自己的个人档案取消标志"

msgid "Flag %flag_title others' profiles"
msgstr "对 %flag_title 其他人的个人档案添加标志"

msgid "Unflag %flag_title others' profiles"
msgstr "对 %flag_title 其他人的个人档案取消标志"

msgid "User"
msgstr "用户"

msgid "Not flagged"
msgstr "未添加标志"

msgid "This filter is only needed if the relationship used has the \"Include only flagged content\" option <strong>unchecked</strong>. Otherwise, this filter is useless, because all records are already limited to flagged content."
msgstr "仅当所使用的关系的“仅包括添加标志的内容”选项<strong>未选中</strong>时，才需要此过滤器。 否则，此过滤器将没有用处，因为所有记录都已限制为已添加标志的内容。"

msgid "By choosing <em>Not flagged</em>, it is possible to create a list of content <a href=\"@unflagged-url\">that is specifically not flagged</a>."
msgstr "通过选择<em>未添加标志</em>，可创建<a href=\"@unflagged-url\">明确未添加标志</a>的内容列表。"

msgid "The name of the selected flag makes a good label."
msgstr "所选标志的名称是适当的标签。"

msgid "By"
msgstr "方式"

msgid "Current user"
msgstr "当前用户"

msgid "Any user"
msgstr "任何用户"

msgid "Include only flagged content"
msgstr "仅包含添加标志的内容"

msgid "If checked, only content that has this flag will be included. Leave unchecked to include all content; or, in combination with the <em>Flagged</em> filter, <a href=\"@unflagged-url\">to limit the results to specifically unflagged content</a>."
msgstr "如果选中此选项，那么将仅包含具有此标志的内容。 如果未选中该选项，则包含所有内容；或者可与<em>已添加标志</em>过滤器结合使用，<a href=\"@unflagged-url\">以将结果限于明确未添加标志的内容</a>。"

msgid "No %type flags exist. You must first <a href=\"@create-url\">create a %type flag</a> before being able to use this relationship type."
msgstr "不存在 %type 标志。 必须先<a href=\"@create-url\">创建 %type 标志</a>，然后才能使用此关系类型。"

msgid "Unflagged first"
msgstr "未添加标志的项优先"

msgid "Flagged first"
msgstr "添加标志的项优先"

msgid "Exposed"
msgstr "已公开"

